{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "山", "id": "山"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "母", "id": "母"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "登", "id": "登"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "臣", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.3637200390813515, "source": "臣", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.0568672196412967, "source": "臣", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "兄", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 2.0286963426746007, "source": "王", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.5178707189086098, "source": "王", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 1.5178707189086098, "source": "王", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "子", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "子", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "子", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 0.5527898228650229, "source": "子", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "子", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.4972514317058743, "source": "大", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.8337236683270872, "source": "大", "target": "恥"}, {"weight": 1.8337236683270872, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.344549292093078, "source": "大", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.344549292093078, "source": "大", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 0.6705728585214062, "source": "山", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "山", "targ